] [17592186059485 1145 "First, we remove the second row and second column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7x & ∗ & -3y \\\\ ∗ & x + 2 y & ∗ \\\\ -y & ∗ & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet\\begin{bmatrix}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{bmatrix} &= \\begin{vmatrix}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 7x \\cdot 5 - (-3y) \\cdot (-y) \\\\\n&= 35x - 3y^{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534073 false] [17592186059485 1145 "First, we remove the second row and second column: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7x & ∗ & -3y \\\\ ∗ & x+2y & ∗ \\\\ -y & ∗ & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =7x\\cdot 5-(-3y)\\cdot (-y) \\\\  & =35x-3{y}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534073 true] [17592186059486 1100 "Given that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5$, find all the possible values of $k$ in the matrix\n$\\begin{bmatrix}k & 3 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & -6\\end{bmatrix}$" 13194139534073 false] [17592186059486 1100 "Given that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5,$ find all the possible values of $k$ in the matrix\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 3 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139534073 true] [17592186059486 1145 "First, we remove the second row and third column:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe minor of $a_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =k\\cdot 2k-3\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =2{k}^{2}+3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5,$ so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{k}^{2}+3 & =5 \\\\ 2{k}^{2} & =2 \\\\ {k}^{2} & =1 \\\\ k & =\\pm 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $k=-1$ and $k=1.$" 13194139534073 true] [17592186059486 1145 "First, we remove the second row and third column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}k & 3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & ∗\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe minor of $a_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet\\begin{bmatrix}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{bmatrix} &= \\begin{vmatrix}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= k \\cdot 2k - 3 \\cdot (-1) \\\\\n&= 2k^{2} + 3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2k^{2} + 3 &= 5 \\\\\n2k^{2} &= 2 \\\\\nk^{2} &= 1 \\\\\nk &= ± 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $k=-1$ and $k=1$." 13194139534073 false] [17592186059676 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276677 13194139534073 true] [17592186059676 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276684 13194139534073 true] [17592186059676 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276713 13194139534073 true] [17592186059676 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276717 13194139534073 true] [17592186059676 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276720 13194139534073 true] [17592186059677 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276691 13194139534073 true] [17592186059677 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276705 13194139534073 true] [17592186059677 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276739 13194139534073 true] [17592186059677 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276746 13194139534073 true] [17592186059678 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276698 13194139534073 true] [17592186059678 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276709 13194139534073 true] [17592186059678 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276723 13194139534073 true] [17592186059678 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276726 13194139534073 true] [17592186059678 1020 #edb/ref 17592186276732 13194139534073 true] [17592186059911 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534073 true] [17592186059911 1100 "What is the minor of $d_{32}$ in the matrix\n\n$D = \\begin{bmatrix}3s & -r^{2} & 2t \\\\ -r & 0 & r \\\\ 5t & 4r & 1\\end{bmatrix}$?" 13194139534073 false] [17592186059911 1100 "What is the minor of ${d}_{32}$ in the matrix\n$D=[\\begin{aligned}3s & -{r}^{2} & 2t \\\\ -r & 0 & r \\\\ 5t & 4r & 1\\end{aligned}]?$" 13194139534073 true] [17592186059911 1145 "First, we remove the third row and 